title: The Atelier-faithful GUI (slices S1–S4) merged into feat/gnomon
summary: |-
  Merge 6967c287 plus fix 463ca37d.
  - What it brings: papercraft day and phosphor night materials (bundled OFL fonts, grain, ink keys); the desk structure (named sessions grouped by project, Active and Past, a quiet centre, folded activity, safe markdown, a palette field, Layout); card layout and the fanned paper pile; motion (fly-in, a decision stamp, fly-off, droop). All Aegis-approved, including the S2/S3 fixes.
  - Post-merge suites: gui 307; gnomon 2403, with two failures:
    - wrapper-channel G-GUI-12 failed under concurrent builder load (its ps scan picks up other processes) and passed when run alone;
    - G-HON-07 flagged design-constant ms values in the gnomon-gui .purpose as unmeasured latency claims; reworded (463ca37d).
  - Open: S5 Workshop caps (in progress, with the stamp label, inert and ask-user follow-ups); the voice countdown has no kernel source.
  - In flight: B1 live words started, F6/F3, and the Paradigm Context mod.
