learnings:
  - The honesty gate (G-HON-07) treats any 'N ms' in docs/.purpose as a latency claim; describe timers as named design constants.
  - Process-scanning falsifiers (G-GUI-12) are sensitive to parallel test runs; rerun alone before trusting a failure.
